					<description><![CDATA[<p>WWE Raw airs live on Monday from the INTRUST Bank Arena in Wichita, Kansas, with a special early&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/398173-wwe-raw-preview-special-early-start-time-title-match-roman-reigns-to-appear-more/">WWE Raw Preview: Special early start time, Title Match, Roman Reigns to appear, More!</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE Raw airs live on Monday from the INTRUST Bank Arena in Wichita, Kansas, with a special early start time of 6:00 pm ET/3:00 pm PT on Netflix.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Raw, which is the go-home show for Saturday&#8217;s Survivor Series: WarGames, will feature the following:</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-WWE Intercontinental Championship Match: Ethan Page defends against Rey Fenix</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Team USA and Team Mexico to reveal their fifth members for Survivor Series</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-World Heavyweight Champion Roman Reigns to appear</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Bayley and Stephanie Vaquer vs. Fatal Influence</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Sol Ruca vs. Lyra Valkyria</p>

<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/398173-wwe-raw-preview-special-early-start-time-title-match-roman-reigns-to-appear-more/">WWE Raw Preview: Special early start time, Title Match, Roman Reigns to appear, More!</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
