		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398162-espn2-to-air-wwe-survivor-series-special-on-thanksgiving-night/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398162-espn2-to-air-wwe-survivor-series-special-on-thanksgiving-night/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:29:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ESPN2]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Survivor Series Special]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398162</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>TV Insider is listing ESPN2 as airing a WWE Survivor Series Special on Thanksgiving, beginning at 5:30 pm&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398162-espn2-to-air-wwe-survivor-series-special-on-thanksgiving-night/">ESPN2 to air WWE Survivor Series special on Thanksgiving</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.tvinsider.com/network/espn2/schedule/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">TV Insider</a> is listing ESPN2 as airing a WWE Survivor Series Special on Thanksgiving, beginning at 5:30 pm ET, with a replay at 7:30 pm ET.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE Survivor Series: WarGames takes place from Daikin Park in Houston, Texas on Saturday, November 28, with a start time of 6:00 pm ET/3:00 pm ET. The event will air live on the ESPN Unlimited App in the United States and Netflix for international fans. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398162-espn2-to-air-wwe-survivor-series-special-on-thanksgiving-night/">ESPN2 to air WWE Survivor Series special on Thanksgiving</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
