		<item>
		<title>TNA Hall of Famer, current talent to host auction in support of Rebel</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398159-tna-hall-of-famer-current-talent-to-host-auction-in-support-of-rebel/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398159-tna-hall-of-famer-current-talent-to-host-auction-in-support-of-rebel/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:46:15 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ALS]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Rebel]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398159</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Gail Kim recently announced that she will join Alisha Edwards in hosting an upcoming auction titled &#8220;Rebel with&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398159-tna-hall-of-famer-current-talent-to-host-auction-in-support-of-rebel/">TNA Hall of Famer, current talent to host auction in support of Rebel</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Gail Kim recently announced that she will join Alisha Edwards in hosting an upcoming auction titled &#8220;Rebel with a Cause&#8221; on December 7.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Items for the auction include a TNA Knockouts Championship belt signed by Knockouts past and present, signed merchandise, and Rebel&#8217;s ring-worn gear, with all proceeds supporting the former talent in her battle with ALS.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Bidding on the auction items will begin this week on the <a href="https://www.whatnot.com/user/theedwards/shop">Whatnot page</a> of Alisha and fellow TNA talent Eddie Edwards.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://www.f4wonline.com/news/aew/gail-kim-and-tna-name-hosting-auction-to-benefit-rebel/">F4WOnline</a></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398159-tna-hall-of-famer-current-talent-to-host-auction-in-support-of-rebel/">TNA Hall of Famer, current talent to host auction in support of Rebel</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
